It's called ROT-13 and is fairly standard in newsgroups, I think. Most 
news readers have the option to decode it. The letters are simply 
rotated 13 places in the alphabet (wrapping around if you go past 'z'). 
There are also webpages that can decode it for you, like 
http://tools.geht.net/rot13.html

